	(text "EoS Feather RP2040, rev A. Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava.\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nOutline, holes and headers from Adafruit's Feather Specification; signals from the Feather RP2040 pinout.\nValues: RP2040 datasheet and Hardware design with RP2040; MCP73831 DS20001984H; AN1149;\nAP2112 DS39724; W25Q128JV Rev. F; SP05xxBA; 0805L; AO3401A; PMEG6010CEH; Kingbright; Omron B3U.\nR7 (QSPI_SS pull-up) is not fitted. GPIO4 (user button) needs its internal pull-up in firmware."
